Arena --(api.github.com)--> Issue ABUTRON ARENA REMOTE -> self-hosted abutron-diagnostics as abutrongha

Allowlist: read_file, list_directory, get_file_info, get_config under /opt/abutron-fx*, /var/lib/abutron-mcp
Blocked: sudo, rm -rf /, abutron-gh-apex-source-stage/rollback, crm-toggle, mt5-install-ex5-live
LIVE=ALWAYS_OFF, no deploy, no LIVE, timeout 3m, concurrency single

Template from ABUTRON-FX-V9 ops/bridge/abutron-ops-arena-remote-v1.yml via PR flow.
Enables Arena bridge demoed in ABUTRON-FX-V9 #1-6 PASS/BLOCKED.
---
